{% func GeneratePuzzleUser(difficulty string, gamesPlayed uint, style string, styleAngles string, recentPuzzles []string, usedAnswers []string) %}
Difficulty:{%s difficulty %}
Games:{%d int(gamesPlayed) %}
Style:{%s style %} - try one of these angles: {%s styleAngles %}
{% if len(recentPuzzles) > 0 %}
Recently used question -> answer pairs for this player - never repeat a question or anything too similar to these:
{% for _, p := range recentPuzzles %}
- {%s p %}
{% endfor %}
{% endif %}
{% if len(usedAnswers) > 0 %}
Answers this player has ever been given, across their entire history - NEVER reuse any of these, no matter how long ago or under what question:
{% for _, a := range usedAnswers %}
- {%s a %}
{% endfor %}
{% endif %}
{% endfunc %}
